ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nMr. Li works in a different city for a long time and rarely gets a chance to go home. On his wife's birthday, he comes home early and prepares a special dinner for her.\n\n[Question]\nMr. Li's wife should be happy about his surprise dinner, but why does she seem angry?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Mr. Li comes home because of work, not genuinely considering her and the family.\nB. Mr. Li's wife is angry at Mr. Li's reckless spending.\nC. Mr. Li does not inform his wife in advance that he is coming home early, which makes her unprepared.\nD. Mr. Li's long-term absence from home has a deep negative impact on his wife and children.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0015011536435903835,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e39ad6006945d28059a2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368410235,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:40:10","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"595bc6891c6f40cdac9589b97878edab"}